SCOPE OF THIS DEDICATION

This dedication covers the data compiled in this repository — the price
collection, its structure and its history.

It does NOT cover, and cannot cover:

  - ARK: Survival Ascended, its name, artwork and logos, which belong to
    Studio Wildcard and Snail Games;
  - the PlayStation, Xbox and Steam names and marks, which belong to Sony
    Interactive Entertainment, Microsoft and Valve respectively;
  - the price figures as facts of those companies' commercial activity.

Prices are collected from public storefronts for informational purposes.
This project is affiliated with none of the companies named above.
